# Docker build context hygiene — security scan 2026-07-31, finding N-29.
#
# The repo had no .dockerignore at all, so every root entry was sent to the
# daemon as build context. Two concrete consequences, not just size:
#
#   1. Dockerfile:15 runs `npm ci`, and Dockerfile:16 is `COPY client ./`.
#      With client/node_modules in the context that COPY lands ON TOP of the
#      tree npm just installed — so a developer's local, host-platform
#      node_modules silently replaced the image's own. Identical commits could
#      produce different images depending on whose machine ran the build.
#   2. `COPY client ./` and `COPY server ./server` also carried .env files,
#      local *.db files and the entire .git history into the image layers,
#      where they survive in the final image even though nothing reads them.
#
# Deny-list rather than allow-list on purpose: the Dockerfile copies client/
# and server/ wholesale, so an allow-list would silently drop every new source
# directory someone adds. Everything listed here must be something the three
# build stages genuinely do not read.
#
# The build reads exactly: client/** (minus the entries below), server/**
# (minus the entries below), and the root package.json — vite.config.ts:23
# resolves ../package.json for __APP_VERSION__, which Dockerfile:23 copies
# explicitly.

# ─── VCS and CI ───
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.github

# ─── Dependency trees — reinstalled in-image by `npm ci` / `go mod download` ───
node_modules
**/node_modules

# ─── Build outputs — regenerated in-image ───
client/dist
server/static/dist
build
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# ─── Secrets and local environment ───
# .env.example is checked-in documentation, so it is explicitly kept. A
# later negation wins over an earlier exclusion, so its position matters.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# ─── Local run artifacts a dev server leaves behind ───
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
server/uploads
server/data
**/*.log

# ─── Shells and harnesses none of the three stages build ───
electron
native
icons
bots
loadtest
e2e
deploy
build.ps1
docker-compose.yml
livekit.yaml
entitlements.mac.plist
.ebignore

# ─── Repo documentation ───
*.md
